  "prompt": "Use case: illustration-story. Asset type: Japanese elementary vocabulary illustrations, sheet 41. Edit the provided 2048x2048 template, painting ONLY inside its sixteen white panels. Every single panel MUST have identical width and height. All horizontal lines must be EXACTLY at 0%,25%,50%,75%,100%, not based on artwork. Keep precisely the 4x4 equal grid and 5 continuous pure magenta #ff00ff lines in each direction, including outer frame. Preserve line position, width and full canvas. Each panel is an independent clear gentle picture-book illustration as isolated vignettes on a pure white background, large and easily understood. Never use magenta for illustration. Avoid all pink, purple and neon colors in artwork, objects, decorations, lighting and shadows. Use warm orange, red, yellow, green, blue and neutral colors. No pink/purple concert lights. Nothing crosses the grid. No text, letters, numbers, labels, symbols resembling writing or watermarks. For abstract words show a concrete situation illustrating the meaning. Diverse natural children and adults, no stereotypes. Correct anatomy and objects. Panels in strict row-major order (left to right, top to bottom):\n1. 購入 — 品物などを買うこと。\n2. 光熱費 — 電気やガスなどのために使うお金。\n3. 紅白 — 赤と白の二つの色。\n4. 勾配 — 坂や斜面の傾き。\n5. 後部 — 物の後ろ側の部分。\n6. 候補 — 選ぶ対象として挙がっている人や物。\n7. 項目 — 内容を分けて並べたときの一つ一つの事柄。\n8. 行楽 — 山や海などに出掛けて楽しむこと。\n9. 恒例 — 毎年など決まって繰り返されること。\n10. 後列 — 後ろ側の列。\n11. 航路 — 船や飛行機が通る道筋。\n12. 小刀 — 小さな刃物。\n13. 小柄 — 体などの形が小さめであること。\n14. 顧客 — 店や会社などの商品やサービスを利用する客。\n15. 国技 — ある国で代表的とされる競技や武術。\n16. 酷暑 — 非常に厳しい暑さ。\nSafety and clarity: Vehicles must be driven only by unmistakable adults, never children. Industrial machinery and knives are used by adults. Do not put a child in a car driver's seat. Keep artwork separated by the measured template grid.\nDo not add numerical claims, prices, quantities, currency denominations, calorie values or stroke-order numbers unless explicitly required by the target word. Mathematical concepts should have neutral concrete examples without unverified numeric diagrams.\nCritical panel2 光熱費: show only a glowing electric lightbulb and a blue gas flame above a bill. NO tap, faucet, water drop, plumbing or water bill. Critical grid: do not move any line from the provided template; third internal horizontal line is exactly at 75% height, all row heights identical. No pink or purple artwork.\n",
